  <Copyright Notice="© Avolites Ltd. 2018" />
  <Thumbnail>f82cd82a-b81f-40f3-8810-f872b8b3d4c0</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="15-04-11" Author="John" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="29-08-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed shutter power on and locate to open.  Simplified shutter." />
  <History Date="29-08-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added RGB cells.  Changed mode 2 and 3 to single patches with pixel mapper compatibility." />
  <History Date="30-08-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed dimmer attribute link from Mode 3 cells." />
  <History Date="11-04-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited removed virtual dimmer from mode 3." />
  <History Date="19-02-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited updated to version 1.4, adding modes 6 and 7." />
  <History Date="19-04-13" Author="RDM Sync Tool" Comment="Added RDM Manufacturer information. Added RDM Fixture information. Added RDM Mode information." />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="29-08-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added channel counts to mode names.  (re)added vdim to mode 3 cells.  Added product thumbnail." />
  <History Date="29-08-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing Atlabase ID's to mode 6 and 7.  Changed name from City Flex 48 to CityFlex 48" />
  <History Date="29-08-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised colour macro functions" />
